I think vrusi1 is a prototype (probably a role) and is "located". The full
definitions says
x1 (ka) is a taste/flavor of/emitted by x2; *x2 tastes of/like x1*.
Also: x2 tastes of seasoning x1, x1 is a seasoned flavor of x2 (=
tsapyvu'i); vrusi may overlap the senses of taste and smell, since the
latter is a significant component of taste. See also kukte, tsapi, cpina,
panci

